      R. Q. 2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنَخْنَخَ</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a camel) <i>lay down upon
its breast, with its legs folded.</i> (Lth, S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
Also, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تنخنخت</span> <i>She,</i> (a camel,) <i>lying upon her
breast, with her legs folded, raised her breast from
the ground.</i> (L.)

